   <blockquote>
    <p>提示：安装时建议使用虚拟环境，避免依赖冲突。海康相机需要额外安装MV-Camera-Manager。</p>
   </blockquote>
   <h3 level="3" id="3.2%20%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7">3.2 参数同步控制技巧</h3>
   <p>多品牌相机协同工作的关键在于：</p>
   <ol>
    <li><strong>参数映射表</strong>：建立厂商特定参数到GenICam标准的映射</li>
    <li><strong>事件同步</strong>：利用GenTL的Event机制实现硬件触发同步</li>
    <li><strong>性能调优</strong>： 
     <ul>
      <li>调整GenTL缓冲区数量（通常4-8个）</li>
      <li>合理设置流控制参数（PacketSize/InterPacketDelay）</li>
     </ul></li>
   </ol>
   <pre class="hljs" style="user-select: text;"><code><ol><li><span class="line-num" data-line="1"></span><span class="hljs-comment"># 多相机参数同步示例</span></li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="2"></span><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">sync_cameras</span>(<span class="hljs-params">cameras</span>):</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="3"></span>    master_exp = cameras[<span class="hljs-number">0</span>].node_map.ExposureTime.value</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="4"></span>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> cam <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> cameras[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>:]:</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="5"></span>        cam.node_map.ExposureTime.value = master_exp</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="6"></span>        cam.node_map.TriggerMode.value = <span class="hljs-string">'On'</span></li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="7"></span>        cam.node_map.TriggerSource.value = <span class="hljs-string">'Line0'</span></li></ol></code></pre>
   <h3 level="3" id="3.3%20%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5">3.3 异常处理最佳实践</h3>
   <p>工业环境中的常见问题及解决方案：</p>
   <ul>
    <li><strong>图像丢帧</strong>：增加GenTL缓冲区，检查网络负载</li>
    <li><strong>参数设置失败</strong>：检查参数是否可写（<code>IsWritable</code>属性）</li>
    <li><strong>相机离线</strong>：实现自动重连机制</li>
   </ul>
   <pre class="hljs" style="user-select: text;"><code><ol><li><span class="line-num" data-line="1"></span><span class="hljs-keyword">try</span>:</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="2"></span>    camera.node_map.AcquisitionStart.execute()</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="3"></span><span class="hljs-keyword">except</span> GENICAM_Exception <span class="hljs-keyword">as</span> e:</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="4"></span>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> e.code == ErrorCode.NOT_AVAILABLE:</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="5"></span>        camera.device_reset()  <span class="hljs-comment"># 使用GenDC功能复位设备</span></li></ol></code></pre>
   <h2 level="2" id="4.%20%E8%BF%9B%E9%98%B6%E5%BA%94%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%9A%E8%B6%85%E8%B6%8A%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E9%87%87%E9%9B%86">4. 进阶应用：超越基础采集</h2>
   <p>掌握GenICam标准后，可以解锁更多高阶应用场景。</p>
   <h3 level="3" id="4.1%20%E8%87%AA%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95">4.1 自定义功能扩展</h3>
   <p>通过GenICam的<code>CustomDevice</code>机制，可以：</p>
   <ol>
    <li>添加厂商特定功能的标准化接口</li>
    <li>实现用户自定义算法模块</li>
    <li>创建跨品牌的功能预设</li>
   </ol>
   <pre class="hljs" style="user-select: text;"><code><ol><li><span class="line-num" data-line="1"></span><span class="hljs-comment">&lt;!-- 自定义功能扩展示例 --&gt;</span></li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="2"></span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Category</span> <span class="hljs-attr">Name</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"CustomFunctions"</span>&gt;</span></li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="3"></span>    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">Command</span> <span class="hljs-attr">Name</span>=<span class="hljs-string">"EnableAIInference"</span>&gt;</span></li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="4"></span>        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">ToolTip</span>&gt;</span>启用内置AI推理功能<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">ToolTip</span>&gt;</span></li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="5"></span>        <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;<span class="hljs-name">pIsAvailable</span>&gt;</span>Always<span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">pIsAvailable</span>&gt;</span></li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="6"></span>    <span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">Command</span>&gt;</span></li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="7"></span><span class="hljs-tag">&lt;/<span class="hljs-name">Category</span>&gt;</span></li></ol></code></pre>
   <h3 level="3" id="4.2%20%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E7%A7%98%E7%B1%8D">4.2 性能优化秘籍</h3>
   <ul>
    <li><strong>并行参数访问</strong>：利用<code>NodeMap</code>的<code>GetMultiple/SetMultiple</code>方法</li>
    <li><strong>流压缩</strong>：启用GenTL的JPEG/LZW传输压缩</li>
    <li><strong>零拷贝处理</strong>：直接访问GenTL缓冲区内存</li>
   </ul>
   <pre class="hljs" style="user-select: text;"><code><ol><li><span class="line-num" data-line="1"></span><span class="hljs-comment"># 批量参数优化示例</span></li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="2"></span>nodes_to_set = {</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="3"></span>    <span class="hljs-string">'AcquisitionFrameRate'</span>: <span class="hljs-number">30.0</span>,</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="4"></span>    <span class="hljs-string">'ExposureTime'</span>: <span class="hljs-number">1000.0</span>,</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="5"></span>    <span class="hljs-string">'Gain'</span>: <span class="hljs-number">12.0</span></li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="6"></span>}</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="7"></span>camera.node_map.set_multiple(nodes_to_set)</li></ol></code></pre>
   <h3 level="3" id="4.3%20%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5%E5%85%BC%E5%AE%B9%E6%80%A7%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1">4.3 未来兼容性设计</h3>
   <p>随着GenICam v1.5的普及，建议：</p>
   <ol>
    <li>采用特性检测而非品牌检测</li>
    <li>为新兴接口（如10GigE Vision）预留扩展</li>
    <li>实现动态功能加载机制</li>
   </ol>
   <pre class="hljs" style="user-select: text;"><code><ol><li><span class="line-num" data-line="1"></span><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">is_feature_supported</span>(<span class="hljs-params">camera, feature_name</span>):</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="2"></span>    <span class="hljs-keyword">try</span>:</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="3"></span>        node = camera.node_map.get_node(feature_name)</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="4"></span>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> node.is_available</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="5"></span>    <span class="hljs-keyword">except</span>:</li><li><span class="line-num" data-line="6"></span>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">False</span></li></ol></code></pre>
   <p>在最近的一个锂电池检测项目中，我们使用GenICam标准在3天内完成了原本需要2周的多品牌相机集成。系统现在可以无缝切换不同厂商的相机，维护成本降低了70%。特别是在添加新型号相机时，只需验证GenICam兼容性，无需重写控制代码——这种灵活性在快速迭代的项目中价值连城。</p>
